  "citation": "Kaiser D P; Tao S; Fu C; Zeng Z; Zhang Q; Wang W; Karl T R (1995): Climate Data Bases of the People's Republic of China 1841-1988 (TR-055). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (USA); Institute of Atmospheric Physics, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Beijing, China. Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/CLI.TR055",
